      "width": 1440,
      "height": 480
    },
    {
      "id": "v3_per_defense_31ch-results-matrix",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 2010,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### \u2694\ufe0f Main Performance Metric: Dedicated Army Composition vs. 5 Reference Villages\n\nDeterministic rollout benchmarks evaluated for the model's exported army composition against all 5 Reference TH18 Base Layouts:\n\n| Attack Composition | **Central Box** | **Offset Diamond** | **Anti-Hydra Ring** | **Anti-Fireball** | **Compact Teaser** | **Avg Destruction** | **3\u2605 Rate** |\n| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **TH18 Thrower + Healer + Totem Smash** | `100% (3\u2605)` | `81% (2\u2605)` | `77% (2\u2605)` | `85% (2\u2605)` | `67% (2\u2605)` | **82.0%** | **20.0%** |\n| **Base Defense Rate (Avg)** | **100.0% (3.0\u2605)** | **81.0% (2.0\u2605)** | **77.0% (2.0\u2605)** | **85.0% (2.0\u2605)** | **67.0% (2.0\u2605)** | **Overall: 82.0%** | \u2014 |\n\n- **Overall Matchup Average**: **`82.0% Destruction`** with **`2.2\u2605 Average Stars`**.\n- **Model Checkpoint Tested**: `trained_models/thrower_healer_totem_smash_ep1918_100pct_3star.pt`."
    },
    {
      "id": "v3_per_defense_31ch-curves-img",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "assets/charts/v3_per_defense_31ch_training_curves.png",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 2500,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 700
    },
    {
      "id": "v3_per_defense_31ch-hyperparams",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 3230,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### \u2699\ufe0f Hyperparameters & Single-Army Training Configuration\n\n| Parameter | Configured Value | Tactical Function in PPO |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| **Dedicated Army Composition** | **`TH18 Thrower + Healer + Totem Smash (Meta)`** | Fixed single army composition trained and exported with the model |\n| **Total Cumulative Episodes** | **`1,918`** | Total combat experience across **2** resumed sessions |\n| **Learning Rate (`lr`)** | `0.0003` | Adam optimizer step size (Critic `2.5x` Actor LR) |\n| **Batch Episodes** | `12` | Number of combat episodes accumulated per PPO policy update |\n| **Minibatch Size** | `128` | Mini-batch sample size for SGD gradient steps |\n| **PPO Epochs (`K`)** | `4` | Number of optimization epochs over each rollout buffer |\n| **Simulation Ticks / Step** | `8` | Combat granularity: `8 ticks` = `0.8s` per agent decision |\n| **Discount Factor ($\\gamma$)** | `0.99` | Long-term return horizon weighting |\n| **GAE Parameter ($\\lambda$)** | `0.95` | Bias-variance tradeoff in advantage estimation |\n| **PPO Clipping ($\\epsilon$)** | `0.2` | Surrogate policy clipping threshold |\n| **Entropy Coefficient** | `0.015` | Normalized per-head exploration incentive |\n| **Village Sampling Mode** | `random` | Sampling distribution across the 5 reference TH18 base layouts |"
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-diagnostics-summary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3930,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 760,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### \ud83e\ude7a Dual-LLM AI Training Diagnostics & v3.0 Architectural Upgrades\n\nFull Dossier: [[experiments/AI_Diagnostics_And_Training_Fixes|AI Training Diagnostics, Telemetry Architecture & PPO Pathology Fixes]]\n\n- **Diagnostic Engines**: **Argon 4 \u2022 OpenCode** (`google-vertex/gemini-4-argon#medium`) & **Flash 3.8 \u2022 AGY** (`gemini-3.8-flash-medium`).\n- **Key Architectural Pillars in `v3.0`**:\n  1. **Single-Army Specialist Training**: Eliminates cross-army gradient interference by training 1 dedicated model per army composition (`{army_slug}_ep{N}_{pct}pct_{stars}star.pt`) and exporting the full `army` recipe inside the `.pt` checkpoint.\n  2. **31-Channel Per-Defense Spatial Grid (`Ch 10..30`)**: Gives each of the 21 TH18 defense types its own dedicated `50\u00d750` input channel (encoding mode for X-Bow/Inferno/SpellTower/MultiGear, facing direction for AirSweeper/Firespitter, and masking Hidden Teslas until revealed).\n  3. **Live Available Inventory (`army_context`, `64-D`)**: Explicitly informs the policy at every step what troops, spells, heroes, equipment abilities, and siege machine are still available and in what remaining quantity (zeroing out depleted slots).\n  4. **Two-Phase Tactical Pacing & Normalized Per-Head Entropy (`reg_entropy`)**: Coordinates frontline wave entry before Siege/Heroes, paces mid-battle Spells (`t >= 40`) and Hero Abilities (`t >= 64`), and balances discrete vs. spatial pointer exploration."
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-diagnostics-chart",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "assets/charts/v3_ai_diagnostics_telemetry.png",
